[0.385933, "o", "╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\r\n║       Claude Code Go SDK - Session Management Demo         ║\r\r\n╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\r\n\r\r\nThis demo showcases the SDK's session management features:\r\r\n  • Custom session IDs with UUID generation\r\r\n  • Session forking (branch conversations)\r\r\n  • Ephemeral sessions (no disk persistence)\r\r\n  • Session resumption and history tracking\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\nð Session Commands:\r\r\n  /normal    - Switch to normal session mode (default)\r\r\n  /custom    - Use a custom-generated session ID\r\r\n  /fork      - Fork from current session into a new one\r\r\n  /ephemeral - Use ephemeral sessions (no disk persistence)\r\r\n  /new       - Start a brand new session\r\r\n  /history   - "]
[0.385946, "o", "Show session history\r"]
[0.385975, "o", "\r\r\n  /status    - Show current session status\r\r\n  /help      - Show this help\r\r\n  exit       - Exit the demo\r\r\n\r\r\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r\r\n│ Mode: normal     | Session: (new)                          │\r\r\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\r\n\r\r\n>>> "]
